      <item row="1" column="1"><widget class="QLineEdit" name="txtCustom"><property name="placeholderText"><string>Optional: 3-letter formatter for a sentence not listed above, e.g. ZZZ</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Leave blank to use the predefined sentence selected above. To decode a sentence that is NOT in the list (proprietary or custom), enter its 3-character formatter here (the 3 characters after the 2-character talker, e.g. the RMC in $GPRMC). You then define its fields by comma position on the next screen.</string></property><property name="maxLength"><number>3</number></property></widget></item>
